{"Inconsistent per-client resource naming between AdminPermissionsSchema (uses internal client id) and ClientPermissions (uses 'client.resource.' + client.getId()) risks misalignment of resource lookup and permission evaluation": 0.40479692816734314, "Tests for All-Clients vs Per-Client flows may be flaky due to potential resource-name resolution issues where per-client lookup uses clientId and All-Clients lookup uses serverId as resource names": 0.09635837376117706, "New Clients resource type and mapping added to AdminPermissionsSchema introduces potential backward-compatibility issues, incorrect resource/scopes wiring, and behavioral changes in authorization checks for client-related operations": 0.12329915910959244, "ClientPermissionsV2 marks many methods as not supported and throws UnsupportedOperationException, indicating incomplete feature with potential runtime errors if these methods are invoked by existing code": 0.6458420753479004, "Possible NullPointerDereference in ClientPermissionsV2.hasPermission when both client-specific resource and global all-clients resource are missing, causing resource.getScopes() to be called on null": 0.8055624961853027, "V2 admin permission evaluator is conditionally enabled behind ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ feature flag, which can lead to environment drift if flag is not consistently enabled across environments or tests": 0.008016769774258137, "Unsynchronized lazy initialization of ClientPermissionsV2 in MgmtPermissionsV2.clients() could race in multi-threaded contexts, leading to inconsistent state or duplicated resources": 0.05979466810822487, "Heavy test suite updates to reference new Clients resource type and V2 permission checks increases risk of gaps in test coverage and potential failures if test infrastructure doesn't align with V2 flows": 0.003930156119167805, "UserPermissionsV2 uses user ID as resource name for per-user resources, highlighting risk that if per-client resources follow a different naming scheme, V2 code path may diverge and cause regressions": 0.3877706825733185}